        "description": "Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Test keys start with `dk_test_` (sandbox data, free daily allowance); live keys start with `dk_live_` (your org's data, billed in credits). Never put a key in the URL.",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "type": "http"
      }
    }
